DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       These functions round _x to the nearest integer value that is not larger
       in magnitude than _x.

RREETTUURRNN VVAALLUUEE
       These functions return the rounded integer value, in floating format.

       If _x is integral, infinite, or NaN, _x itself is returned.

